WEBVTT - Design system and frontend: agent skills for TYPO3 (en)

1
00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:06.467
A design system only helps when it reaches the
content elements.

2
00:00:07.567 --> 00:00:13.797
Design system and frontend: four skills for
TYPO3 v14.

3
00:00:15.097 --> 00:00:23.991
Turns shadcn/ui presets into Fluid content
elements with semantic tokens, previews and seed
data.

4
00:00:25.341 --> 00:00:30.474
Switch the preset, switch to dark mode: every
element follows.

5
00:00:32.991 --> 00:00:42.199
Builds an accessible design-system page in your
site, with design.md, tokens.json and a one-page
PDF.

6
00:00:43.549 --> 00:00:51.451
It asks which installation and which page to use
before it writes, so nothing lands on a site you
did not choose.

7
00:00:52.851 --> 00:00:59.655
Sets up Vite 7 for TYPO3 sitepackages, with an
entry per content element.

8
00:01:01.005 --> 00:01:11.049
TYPO3 v14 removed the core’s own concatenation
and compression of frontend assets, so a build
tool now does that work.

9
00:01:12.449 --> 00:01:19.854
Redraws and migrates extension icons to the v14
line style, for light and dark mode.

10
00:01:21.204 --> 00:01:30.595
Heavy, filled icons look foreign next to the v14
core, and a module icon that vanishes in dark
mode is a bug.

11
00:01:32.195 --> 00:01:36.570
Open source. Clone the skills, and help us
improve them.
